      "body": "The board of directors of GSP Crop Science Limited at its meeting held on May 26, 2026, recommended a Final Dividend of INR 1.00/- (Rupee One Only) per equity share having face value of INR 10/- each, i.e. @10% for the financial year ended March 31, 2026, subject To Approve the members at the ensuing Annual General Meeting (\"AGM\") of the Company. The dividend, if declared by the members at the ensuing AGM, shall be paid on or before 30 days from the date of AGM. The Book Closure and Record Date for dividend purpose will be intimated in due course.",
